    "uncertainty_reported": "n",
    "code_released": "https://github.com/paveenH/RSN",
    "peer_reviewed": "Annual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics",
    "problems": "The authors state that the analysis primarily covers dense 7B–8B models and knowledge/reasoning benchmarks; larger models, MoE architectures, and other task types remain untested. The reported results do not provide error bars or confidence intervals.",
    "rows_left_out": "Other confidence and reasoning benchmark results, cross-model transfer outcomes, and prompt-format outcomes are omitted because they concern confidence steering rather than the claim's representation geometry.",
